{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DirectedIncidenceGraphView","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Base","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Base","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph","text":"DirectedHypergraph","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Positions ","type":"text"},{"code":"0 ..< P_s","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are the source incidences, hyperedge by hyperedge in index order and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"within one in ","type":"text"},{"code":"sourceIndices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"P_s + q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is target incidence ","type":"text"},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", in the same order. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"per-incidence array is indexed by edge position. A view is a snapshot, so its own positions","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"never change, but they are valid for the hypergraph only until its next mutation: the view of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the mutated hypergraph numbers the incidences afresh (on ","type":"text"},{"code":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", inserting","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one cell shifts every later incidence by one).","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every index member reads the base’s rows, shifted where they hold hyperedges:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"successorIndices(ofIndex: i)"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"outHyperedgeIndices(ofIndex: i)"},{"type":"text","text":" plus n, and of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"n + p"},{"type":"text","text":" it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"targetIndices(ofHyperedgeAt: p)"},{"type":"text","text":"; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"predecessorIndices"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inHyperedgeIndices"},{"type":"text","text":" plus n, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sourceIndices"},{"type":"text","text":". Graph algorithms therefore run on the view without hashing a vertex. The view"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does not offer "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"_withSuccessorIndexRows"},{"type":"text","text":", whose contract needs edge positions in row order."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Costs are as for "},{"code":"IncidenceGraphView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": O(1) reads on "},{"code":"IncidenceList","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which stores its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"incidences; on another base a hyperedge’s incidence numbers are a range, O(1), "},{"code":"edges[q]","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"binary-searches and selects by rank, O(log m + ⌈n\/64⌉) on "},{"code":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex’s "},{"code":"outEdges","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"inEdges","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is computed from "},{"code":"_memberRank","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", O(d·⌈n\/64⌉) on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/BidirectionalDirectedGraph","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:11Hypergraphs26DirectedIncidenceGraphViewV","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"DirectedIncidenceGraphView.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView.swift#L41"},"modules":[{"name":"Hypergraphs"}],"title":"DirectedIncidenceGraphView","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DirectedIncidenceGraphView","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DirectedIncidenceGraphView","kind":"identifier"}]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/Edges-swift.struct","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/Neighbors","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/OutEdges"],"anchor":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/init(base:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphVi